<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>Kunigami 80 degree change for instant shots into goal for the game Locked on Roblox.
I suggest using a 0.8 sens with 1820x1900.
thanks to this macro u can shoot the ball into the net without having to rotate on ur own and it automatically locks in the corner :D
this was the 2nd part of the first form script btw have fun !!!
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 64
RightDown 1
Delay 128 ms
MoveTo 930 492
Delay 64
MoveR -21 -1
Delay 64
RightUp 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>